<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Note that for FY23, Newark Charter actually earned o=
ne principal and 8 assistant principals based on 191.43 units (9 administra=
tors total). The scenario above would result in four principals and 4.65 as=
sistant principals (8.65 administrators
 total), a reduction of 0.35 units. This information is provided merely for=
 comparison purposes. The Department&#8217;s position is that charter schoo=
ls are treated as a single school, regardless of the number of buildings us=
ed for operations.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">We hope this information is helpful in understanding=
 why charter schools are treated as a single school/building.
<o:p></o:p></p>
