<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Jennifer and Brook,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I was researching information on how Principal Units=
 were funded as NCS has four buildings but yet only earns one Principal Uni=
t. The excerpt below out of Title 14 Chapter 13 Section 1307 indicates that=
 in order to qualify for more than
 one Principal funded unit, one of two criteria must be met:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<ol style=3D"margin-top:0in" start=3D"1" type=3D"1">
<li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:.25in;mso-list:l1 level=
1 lfo3">E<span style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans=
-serif;color:#333333;background:white">mploy 1 full-time principal for each=
 administrative unit in a school building OR</span><o:p></o:p></li><li clas=
s=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">=
<span style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;co=
lor:#333333;background:white">Combination of school buildings having 15 or =
more Division I state units of pupils</span><o:p></o:p></li></ol>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">NCS has four buildings under its span of responsibil=
ity as approved by all the Major Modifications submitted and approved by DD=
OE each earning more than 15 DIV I units per building:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Primary School - 890590<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Intermediate School - 890589<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Junior High School - 890591<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Senior High School - 890588<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please review this request and let me know what the =
next steps are in awarding this funded units per DE code.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Thank you.<o:p></o:p></p>
